@startuml
title Green Industry Copilot

actor User
participant Frontend
participant "FastAPI Backend" as API
participant "Process Extractor" as Extractor
participant "Azure OpenAI\n(Extraction Model)" as AOAI1
participant "Process Optimizer" as Optimizer
participant "Azure OpenAI\n(Optimization Model)" as AOAI2
participant "Foundry IQ" as FIQ
database "Azure AI Search" as Search
participant "Chat Manager" as Chat
participant "Azure OpenAI\n(Chat Model)" as AOAI3

== Document Upload ==

User -> Frontend : Upload document
Frontend -> API : POST /upload

API -> Extractor : extract_processes(file)

Extractor -> AOAI1 : Structured extraction
AOAI1 --> Extractor : Process graph JSON

Extractor --> API : Original process graph

API -> FIQ : upload_graph()
FIQ -> Search : Store process documents
Search --> FIQ : Indexed

API --> Frontend : Process graph

== Process Optimization ==

User -> Frontend : Optimize processes
Frontend -> API : POST /optimize

API -> Optimizer : optimize_processes()

Optimizer -> AOAI2 : Sustainability optimization
AOAI2 --> Optimizer : Optimized graph

Optimizer --> API : Optimized process graph

API -> FIQ : upload_graph()
FIQ -> Search : Update indexed knowledge
Search --> FIQ : Indexed

API --> Frontend : Optimized graph

== Chat and Question Answering ==

User -> Frontend : Ask question
Frontend -> Chat : chat message

Chat -> FIQ : retrieve(query)
FIQ -> Search : Semantic search
Search --> FIQ : Relevant processes

FIQ --> Chat : Retrieved knowledge

Chat -> AOAI3 : Generate response\nusing history + Foundry IQ knowledge
AOAI3 --> Chat : Answer

Chat --> Frontend : Chat response
Frontend --> User : Display answer

@enduml